  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6fa88630-df84-4154-83ac-5331c2c46f49",
    "name": "EcommerceAPI_miniProject",
    "description": "## EcommerceAPI Mini Project\n\nThis collection covers the core API workflows for a basic e-commerce application. It is organized around three functional areas:\n\n### Authentication\n- **Login** – Authenticates a user and retrieves an access token via `POST /auth/login`.\n- **User Profile** – Fetches the currently authenticated user's profile via `GET /auth/me`.\n\n### Products\n- **Products** – Retrieves the full list of available products via `GET /products`.\n- **Fetch Single Product** – Fetches details for a specific product using a dynamic `productId` variable via `GET /products/{{productId}}`.\n\n### Cart\n- **Add New Cart** – Creates a new cart for a user via `POST /carts/add`.\n- **Cart Details** – Retrieves the details of a specific cart via `GET /carts/31`.\n\n---\n\n**Base URL** is managed through the `{{base_URL}}` environment variable. Authentication state is stored in the `accessToken` variable, which is expected to be set after a successful login.\n\nThis collection is intended for development and testing of the e-commerce API endpoints.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "56889497"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "//add scripts to extract token from response\r",
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {\r",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "let jsonData = pm.response.json();\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", jsonData.accessToken);\r",
              "jsonData.accessToken\r",
              "\r",
              "console.log(pm.environment.get(\"accessToken\"));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n    \"username\": \"emilys\",\r\n    \"password\": \"emilyspass\"\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_URL}}/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{base_URL}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
